SLAP-2M pose

Multi-camera 3D pose of one to four mice in an arena with graded levels of environmental enrichment. Eight synchronized grayscale cameras at 1280x1024, 30 fps except the 13 sessions of 2022-10-19 at 60 fps.

Per-camera 2D pose in native SLEAP .slp and analysis .h5 files, and the 3D pose, reprojections
and camera calibration in the lab's native HDF5 and TOML files. models/ holds the SLEAP models.

Files keep their native formats and bytes. The pose and calibration suffixes are not part
of the BIDS specification. Each JSON sidecar describes the files that share its name.

Known issues

- Cameras side and sideL have no proofread 2D. Their 2D comes from a separate side-camera model.
- Six sessions (10072022142111 to 10072022151549) have a blank duration in the master sheet. Their frame counts are fine.
- Heights up to 393 mm and floor dips to -42 mm occur only in difficulty 5 to 7 sessions, consistent with climbing.
- The side-camera model itself (260321_155949.bottomup.n=3558) is not part of the deposit.
